sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    box Aqua Frontend
        actor U as User
        participant W as Web
    end
    box Backend
        participant A as API
        participant D as DB
    end
    U->>W: Open page
    activate W
    W->>+A: GET /items
    loop Every page
        A->>D: SELECT items
        D-->>A: rows
    end
    alt cache hit
        A-->>W: 200 cached
    else cache miss
        A->>D: refresh
        A-->>W: 200 fresh
    end
    par notify
        A-)U: push
    and log
        A-)D: audit
    end
    deactivate A
    Note right of W: renders list
    Note over U,W: done
    W-->>U: page
    deactivate W
